<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has formally allied with the M23 rebels, creating a coalition that is now attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and the wounding of former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. In Ituri, suspected ADF rebels killed 77 civilians. The coalition’s actions have intensified fighting in the eastern provinces, and the conflict recorded 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5ZYTU4dFZmU1BaY09wRGhSRlljeWVrc2JuNU1vZnkweVI3TnB0RzVZN3RTUXlpS2JRbTVsNjFPWlhhcUNfb0hoSkdyUGJPZURYOGRTcVE0ZzI?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOLUM3S0lRQXcwR200UGtGeDdVdmNnYURRZ3hRc1FwMFJvU1dRX0pjdGFmV2NId3N3T21HUnctZWFkU0pWLTRNYzE5NDlQc3ZrTVhKd2NkcEdlVkdZX3dpM2RBSGMyRlh3MHRVVUxNTlhQeGxMVDItaWFYc25xb2lBWGg5amlHT0NwUXRXWUJsY3FqbWtsUXRpSlRRRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOaVktOEo3N210U2FWUXV1Q0UwMEZyZVk5U3p4Tmp1dm90R1JZRS1YQ2RHV29qYktuVjhVQXJQaGw4djliYUl0bW85anN0QVpqSF92NVFBR0lKa3BGNm56Q0RiQ0haVjlTQjZzdW5qOGZYYkhxS28zLXlCcFZHRzVTWkV1MTJMQWZqUS13TTFaSWd2VVdORmNvWA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOR3lVYnFyaXdWdGxTRlNtOFNpbXN4Mkh3T09lVDNFLXVrOHg4Vjg3RWhVdlc1WXJUdVN3U2hpMkx6aFZYUGdtZ0JTNFNNbVRKXzd2YWpxQkZITGxfeFZLamF1enBVbWxDT2stOS1tWkxLRTZjWDhOR2g0QUs4SVE0dEdaNnJYQ20tRnBkb3pwRlp0d0VPMnpNcFVkUG5mdlZmRjktbl9zQ0NUdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UG Diplomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQYmJXR1dZWDJT